<EditPage
  eyebrow="About"
  title="About Peptide Connect"
  lead="A research-first verification product for the fragmented research-peptide market."
 >
 <p>
   Peptide Connect is building a continuously updated system for supplier identity,
    analytical evidence, provenance, testing coverage, transparency, and
    historical consistency — the intelligence layer between fragmented
    peptide-market data and the researchers who rely on it.
  </p>
  <p>
    The product normalizes inconsistent supplier identities, links analytical
     reports to compounds and lots where possible, distinguishes
     vendor-submitted testing from independently sourced evidence, records claims
     separately from verified facts, and preserves the source behind every
     material assertion.
    </p>
  <p>
    It does <strong>not</strong> reduce a supplier to a "good" / "bad" / "safe"
     label. Instead it shows what the available evidence actually establishes —
     and where uncertainty remains.
     </p>
 </EditPage>
